   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>化验频率低，产品质量波动难以及时发现。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>过程变量与带时间戳的化验标签。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>在化验间隔内估计辛烷值，提示残差变化。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 240' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='过程变量与化验值的时间断层'><text x='20' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>同一根时间轴上的三个世界</text><line x1='60' y1='20' x2='60' y2='215' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M60,62 L90,58 L120,66 L150,60 L180,65 L210,59 L240,64 L270,60 L300,66 L330,61 L360,65 L390,59 L420,64 L450,60 L480,65 L510,61 L540,66 L570,60 L600,64 L630,61 L660,65 L690,60' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.5'/><text transform=\"translate(-150 -18)\" x='696' y='64' font-size='8.5' fill='#2875c7'>DCS 过程变量：秒级连续</text><line x1='60' y1='100' x2='690' y2='100' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><path d='M60,180 L130,177 L200,179 L270,198 L340,186 L410,182 L480,188 L550,201 L620,192 L690,183' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><text transform=\"translate(-150 -35)\" x='696' y='185' font-size='8.5' fill='#9ba3a9'>真实辛烷值（没人看见）</text><line x1='60' y1='195' x2='690' y2='195' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='6 3'/><text transform=\"translate(-90 17)\" x='696' y='198' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>规格下限 92.0</text><rect x='250' y='155' width='70' height='55' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.08'/><rect x='530' y='155' width='70' height='55' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.08'/><g fill='#d47a3a'><rect x='95' y='178' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='165' y='175' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='235' y='177' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='305' y='196' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='375' y='184' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='445' y='180' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='515' y='186' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='585' y='199' width='7' height='7'/><rect x='655' y='190' width='7' height='7'/></g><g fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1'><circle cx='60' cy='180' r='3.5'/><circle cx='130' cy='177' r='3.5'/><circle cx='200' cy='179' r='3.5'/><circle cx='270' cy='198' r='3.5'/><circle cx='340' cy='186' r='3.5'/><circle cx='410' cy='182' r='3.5'/><circle cx='480' cy='188' r='3.5'/><circle cx='550' cy='201' r='3.5'/><circle cx='620' cy='192' r='3.5'/></g><line x1='63' y1='180' x2='92' y2='180' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='.8' marker-end='url(#arR5b)'/><line x1='273' y1='198' x2='302' y2='198' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='.8' marker-end='url(#arR5b)'/><line x1='553' y1='201' x2='582' y2='201' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='.8' marker-end='url(#arR5b)'/><defs><marker id='arR5b' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='6' refX='4.5' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748b'/></marker></defs><text x='20' y='232' font-size='9.5' fill='#64748b'>○ 采样时刻 → ▣ 化验到手：4 h 滞后。两次越限（红区）里，等化验发现时产品早已进罐——化验只能「验尸」，不能「救火」</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
