   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>数据都在手上：<b>DCS 秒级过程数据 + 每班化验单</b>。这个场景 80% 的功夫花在「对齐」——化验值必须锚定在采样时刻，而不是出报告时刻；差这 4 个小时，模型学到的全是错位的相关。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>过程变量</span><span class='cl-s'>温度、流量、压力等，秒级历史 2 年以上</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，需清洗坏点</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>化验数据</span><span class='cl-s'>辛烷值等质量指标，每班 1—2 次</span></span><span class='cl-n'>训练标签，需含精确采样时刻</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>在线分析仪</span><span class='cl-s'>若已配置，近红外等</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作参考基准，非必需</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>采样-化验时间戳</span><span class='cl-s'>采样时刻与出报告时刻分开记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>对齐的关键，缺了要补录</span></div></div>"
